{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve included JSON null values**\n\nAn enabled value that is actually `null` is represented identically to excluded or unavailable content, and the wire map subsequently omits it. Thus a successful handler returning `null` has no `output` field despite output inclusion being enabled. Track field presence separately from value and emit JSON null when included; omit only excluded or unavailable fields. Add null input/output wire-shape tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pooCU","finding_digest":"7222336e2d78db6abd6301708845ad1644039532304641747c6281929560f9e7","finding_id":"arf_v1_oirdg3rnpdnwvpldafyiqrnncz","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::applydatacontent::explicit-null-preservation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::applydatacontent::explicit-null-preservation","line":349,"observation_digest":"f81014f712acaa83d0b8ce05de269e9eb72d03c63a3c4bce3f42216c887fe151","observation_id":"aro_v1_7aibj5ysvsvihufyzyc54ju6t2","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_oirdg3rnpdnwvpldafyiqrnncz","published_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_brd3pfs5righqijat55m42wkqi","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"3b6eb771df61db642c999e1d308344c97b3cf686","reviewer":"codex","start_line":348,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_xgaxnbnpd5mhrl6aslo5ecaglo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
